course: dictionary
lesson: 2473
title: Words for family
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A daughter is a girl or woman who is someone's child. Her parents are her mother and father, and if she has a brother, he is her son. Use this word for a child who is a girl.
explain: Read the words around the word for clues. «The gaoler's kind daughter, who loves animals, asks to look after him.» A gaoler is the person who looks after prisoners, so his daughter is a girl who is his child. Her kindness and her love of animals tell you about her too.
explain: Some words often go with daughter: «only daughter», «eldest daughter» and «mother and daughter». When there is more than one, the word changes to daughters.
fact: A daughter is a girl or woman who is someone's child.
fact: The plural of daughter is daughters: one daughter, two daughters.
fact: «Eldest daughter» means the oldest girl in a family.
fact: «Ada was the daughter of the poet Lord Byron.» Ada was a girl, and her father was the poet.
fact: An elephant family is made of mothers, daughters, aunts and babies, and the oldest grandmother leads them.
exercise: «The gaoler's kind daughter asks to look after him.» Who is the daughter? | *A girl who is the gaoler's child | A teacher at school | A prisoner in the castle | The gaoler's son
exercise: What is the plural of daughter? | son | *daughters | sister | girl
exercise: «Ada was the daughter of the poet Lord Byron.» Who was Ada's father? | *The poet Lord Byron | Her sister | A teacher | Her mother
test: «An elephant herd is a family of mothers, daughters, aunts and babies.» Who walks at the front of the herd? | Her daughter | *The grandmother, called the matriarch | A brother | A young calf
test: What does «eldest daughter» mean? | *The oldest girl in a family | A girl who lives far away | A girl with no brothers | The youngest girl in a family
exam: Olena's name is Olena Petrivna, which means Olena, daughter of Petro. What does daughter mean here? | Petro's son | Petro's wife | *A girl who is Petro's child | Petro's brother
